# Moya — project intelligence

AGENTS.md wins on product/desktop/auth. This file is the living journal. The public repo is MIT (Lefa Moffat). Do not re-add xAI App Builder skills (`.grok/skills`) to git.

## Voice (do not lie)

- Local Conversation speaker = Kokoro ids (`af_heart`, `af_bella`, `bm_fable`, …). Not Pocket (jean, alba). Not Mac `voiceURI`.
- `GET http://127.0.0.1:8765/v1/voices` is 404. Do not invent a Pocket+Kokoro list as fallback.
- `conversationVoice` / `localConversationVoice` coerce unknown Local ids to `af_heart`.
- Settings must `await` the `settings.voice` act before `restartVoiceIfNeeded()`.
- Voice Settings is one Provider, like Model. System is the built-in device voices (Web Speech), labeled System on every OS — not a Mac option. Rate/pitch show only for System. Do not hide Base URL in an accordion.
- Sending `session.audio.output.voice` is not proof the sidecar spoke it. Upstream Kokoro remaps STT `en` → British and used to force `bm_fable`. Handler on this machine was patched; running process must be restarted.
- `scripts/voice-system.test.mjs` staying green is necessary, not sufficient. Hear Heart vs Fable or say you have not.

## Environment

- Store writes go through `act()` (`settings.voice`, `settings.provider`, `settings.patch`, `ui.*`). Do not add a second settings path.
- Speech is compiled from receipts. No invented live status.

## Auth / desktop

- Packaged app: auth off, no Node server, identifier `africa.moya`.
- `createAuthClient` needs `http(s)` baseURL. Never raw `tauri://`.

## Type

- Two sans faces only: display **Bricolage Grotesque**, UI **Ubuntu**. Self-host via `@fontsource`.
- Do not bring back Instrument Serif, Source Serif, Figtree, Playfair, Fraunces, Newsreader, or a `serif` fallback on `--font-display`. If the face fails to load, Times must not appear.
- `scripts/brand-ssot.test.mjs` must stay red if those families return. A token swap is not enough — check computed `font-family` on `.type-display` in the running app.

## Shipping surfaces

- Do not advertise a GitHub DMG as the Mac install. Apple blocks unsigned internet downloads. Menu/README go to `#mac-app` (clone + `pnpm package:mac`). A Releases `.dmg` is optional.
- Pull requests are the path onto `main`. `.github/workflows/ci.yml` must run `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, and `pnpm test`.
- `scripts/shipping-contract.test.mjs` must stay red if those workflows disappear or stop publishing.
- Version is the last `vX.Y.Z` tag plus one patch per commit after it. `pnpm package:mac` and Release both apply that number. Do not add a second bump command or workflow. Do not hand-edit one of package.json / tauri.conf.json / Cargo.toml / Cargo.lock / `APP_VERSION`.

## Owner preference

- Do not claim Voice, Settings, or fonts work from tests or “should”. State evidence.
- Memory bank is required. Read it at the start of every task. Update `activeContext.md` and `progress.md` after significant work.
